glance    glance-distgit    05968b35c77aaae4b3c5a535bb68052e36b91c89  openstack-glance.spec       32.0.0  1  glance-32.0.0.tar.gz               e92cce22edf09f573c7083cecb783f19b526a3be9bc34c4018e658962b9d98e5  glance  0xb8e9315f48553ec5aff9ffe5e69d97da9efb5aff
neutron   neutron-distgit   fa1f5135e66282364250f2f5630a48423f497099  openstack-neutron.spec      28.0.2  1  neutron-28.0.2.tar.gz              cdaf45a2100de5233e4c1cc7c01c9df2b634510a0f0436913f73f29d42d325ee  neutron  0x30566c450e41d7c91e442dfb231f942f608ddeff
nova      nova-distgit      0b94abfd93c4935230ec4f2395f04197374eee4b  openstack-nova.spec         33.0.2  1  nova-33.0.2.tar.gz                 84ab864ced8867f2989f3ba65ead61a7e39891ee7ea693850331636ac9d360ea  nova  0x30566c450e41d7c91e442dfb231f942f608ddeff
horizon   horizon-distgit   d5ba40128726567910302c43a42bc08493c4893c  python-django-horizon.spec  25.7.3  1  horizon-25.7.3.tar.gz              0a9a1d90475bc290d4af934ff53b9ed4c2cbe063150ca48a17c64c03447c5117  horizon  0x30566c450e41d7c91e442dfb231f942f608ddeff
#
# --- libraries -----------------------------------------------------------
# The six services above cannot be built without these at their 2026.1
# versions: RDO's EL10 trunk carries 2025-era builds that are older than what
# 2026.1 requires. Versions are the exact pins from the 2026.1
# upper-constraints file, which is what "one release" means for a library.
# os-traits releases independently of the cycle; 3.6.0 is its 2026.1 pin.
#
